			"color":"#232",
			"widgets_values":[
				"The first frame of the video must be exactly the attached image.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description\n[Shot 1] The video opens in a dynamic, highly detailed 2D anime style. A fierce male swordsman with spiky dark hair and a scarred face, wearing a tattered yellow and brown cloak, stands in a low, defensive combat stance. He holds a brilliantly glowing katana horizontally across his body. Against a dark, smoky blue background filled with floating black feathers and glowing embers, a high-velocity bullet strikes the flat of his blade. A blinding flash and a violent shower of bright orange sparks erupt exactly at the point of impact. The camera is locked in a static medium close-up.\n[Shot 2] At 00:01.500, the swordsman suddenly lunges forward, sprinting at an explosive speed. The camera breaks into a rapid, shaky tracking shot, executing high-speed whip pans left and right that closely follow his chaotic, evasive footwork to build intense urgency. He fiercely wields his glowing sword, executing a rapid, fluid sequence of strikes—a wide horizontal sweep, a powerful vertical downward chop, and a sharp diagonal slash—expertly deflecting unseen incoming attacks. \n[Shot 3] At 00:04.500, the camera rapidly pulls back into a wide cinematic long shot to reveal the wider battlefield environment. The swordsman is now positioned on the right side of the frame. On the left stands his opponent: a mysterious enemy clad entirely in black ninja-like garb with a face-concealing mask. The enemy lunges forward, suddenly drawing a katana. The two warriors clash in the center of the frame. Their sword blades collide violently, locking together and sending a massive, radiant shockwave of energy and sparks outward.\n\noverall_soundscape\nA sharp, high-pitched metallic ping of a bullet ricocheting off steel, instantly followed by the sizzling crackle of sparks. Heavy, rapid thudding of boots pounding against the ground and the aggressive flapping of a tattered cloak in the wind begin immediately. Several loud, consecutive gunshots echo rapidly from off-screen. A series of sharp, aggressive metallic swishes ring out as the sword violently slices the air. The sequence culminates in a massive, deafening clang of heavy steel striking steel, transitioning into the harsh, sustained grinding noise of two locked metal blades under extreme pressure.\n\nnon_diegetic_music\nA high-octane, fast-paced anime action track featuring aggressive, distorted electric guitar riffs, rapid heavy drumming, and intense synthesizers that continuously drive the frantic rhythm and chaotic tension of the battle."
